 fun in the sun.\n• Catalina/Golden West welcomes your freight shipments - Daily ol\n- for special requirements,\nreight charters available\n1972 — SUMMER SCHEDULE FOR CATALINA ISLAND\nALL FARES INCLUDE 8% FEDERAL TRANSPORTATION TAX\nSummEr 1972\nFly do\nCatalina Asland\nVia...\nCATALINA\nAIR LINES\n• SANTA ROSA\nSAN FRANCISCO\n• SAN JOSE\n• MONTEREY\nMO AVE\nONTARIO\nSANTA BARBARA\nOXNARD\nLOS ANGELES INTERNATIONAL\nLONG BEACH\nCATALINA ISLAND\n•TWO HARRORS\n• AIRPORT-IN-THE-SKY\n•AVALON\nRIVERSIDE\n- PALM SPRINGS\n- FULLERTON\nANTA AN.\nCATALINA AIR LINES Division of Golden West Airlines, is the world's\nmost experienced commuter airline. We're proud of our fifteen years\nof service to Santa Catalina Island. More than 1,000,000 people have\nflown with us between Catalina and the Mainland!\nRESERVATIONS \u0026 INFORMATION\nLong Beach\n.. (213) 421-8281\nLos Angeles\n(213) 624-8621\nOrange County\n(714) 827-7700\nCatalina Island\nAvalon 385\nFor Information on Charter Flights call...\n(213) 646-2970 Evenings, Sat./Sun.\n(714) 546-6570 Mon. thru Fri., 8:30AM - 5:30PM\n35M 6/72\n2005.132.016.004\nCatalina\nBy Air\nFrom\nLos Angeles\nLong Beach\nand now\nOrange County\nAirport\n(Santa Ana)\nCatalina /Golden West\nGolden West\nCatalina /Golden West Airlines"
